{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016W6WHRz5szSievjV3mFb5m","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 phase-gated-compound-sparse 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (11 个)\\n\\n- **phase2_ext_seed123**: ALLOCATED — \\n- **phase2_3method_selfit**: RUNNING — \\n- **phase1b_self_iterate**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase1_gpt2_collapse**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_serial_v4**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_serial_v3**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp_ext_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_rgds_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_ext_v1**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp_rgds_v1**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp_rgds_v3**: DONE (failed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-13\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| phase2_3method_selfit | RGDS diversity selection 能减缓 self-iterate 模式下的多样性崩塌（rare n-gram 丢失），表现优于 uncurated baseline，至少与 external_only 持平 | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- phase2_ext_seed123: external_only seed=123 复现实验，验证 Phase 2 external_only 结果的可重复性（N>1 统计检验准备）（已分配 ? GPU:?，等待提交）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **phase1b_self_iterate** (success): 固定 generator 阻断 feedback loop 是前两次实验未崩塌的根因。Student-as-generator 自迭代模式（GPT2-125M 8 代）应能诱导可测量的 model collapse（RankMe >20% 下降，PPL 恶化） ← 基于 phase1_gpt2_collapse\\n- **phase1_gpt2_collapse** (negative): —\\n- **mvp_serial_v4** (negative): —\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 1 / 负向 2 / 失败 3 / 共 9\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-11235: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp_rgds_v1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp_ext_v1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp_rgds_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp_ext_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp_rgds_v3: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp_serial_v3: 已被终止 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011ZShWv2RSoWe4y4NwFZRff","session_id":"c9d03048-500b-46c5-8a1d-0e97b262c580","uuid":"f7cff40d-dcd4-44d1-929b-bd258e5fa8a2","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:58:24.008Z"}
